abstract: >-
  HMM study on the impact of skin abberations on facial
  exploration behavior


  The R code used to fit the Participant x Media HMMs,
  perform feature extraction, implement state matching, and
  conduct the clustering analyses (PAM, hierarchical:
  average and complete linkage). 
